msgid "Plugging in custom components"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Quarkus extension for Hibernate Search with Hibernate ORM will automatically\n"
"inject components annotated with `@SearchExtension` into Hibernate Search."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The annotation can optionally target a specific persistence unit (`@SearchExtension(persistenceUnit = \"nameOfYourPU\")`),\n"
